# Inkling 2 Mini local setup — pinned facts.
# Agents: do not invent replacements. Scripts refuse values that contain
# the substring <UNVERIFIED: . Override paths and profiles with env vars,
# not by inventing filenames, sizes, or SHA-256s.
#
# Status labels in README.md (CONFIRMED / UNVERIFIED / conflict).
# Numbers here are copied from /workspace/handoffs/inkling2mini-facts.md
# and/or primary sources opened while writing this package (2026-11-20).

# --- install layout ---
# INSTALL_DIR is set by lib.sh from INKLING_INSTALL_DIR or $HOME/inkling2-mini.
# Do not put a home-path default here; this file is copied around.

