# Upstream ggml-org alternative (CITED merge). Opt-in only, never automatic.
# PR #32694 merged at 2026-11-20T22:01:08Z, commit 29b52d398b294509746ec0a3f28948a3107c0213
# Latest checked upstream tag as of 2026-11-20 4:49 PM CT: b12596 (22:43:55Z) still does
# NOT contain the merge (also checked b12591 at 22:30Z). Homebrew llama.cpp:
# v1.0.0 / v1.0.0-b12359-b1b770d — do not use for Inkling Mini.
# INKLING_INSTALL_MODE=upstream builds this commit for inkling2_loop files (UNVERIFIED).
# The source tarball SHA is not in the facts file. If UPSTREAM_SOURCE_SHA256 is
# set, it is required. If empty, the first opt-in fetch records the SHA under
# $INSTALL_DIR/results/upstream-source-sha256.txt (trust-on-first-use, UNVERIFIED);
# later fetches must match. Independently confirm the hash. Do not invent one here.
UPSTREAM_LOOP_PR=32694
UPSTREAM_LOOP_MERGE_COMMIT=29b52d398b294509746ec0a3f28948a3107c0213
UPSTREAM_LOOP_RELEASE_TAG=
UPSTREAM_SOURCE_SHA256=

